<title>USA: First Colony says shareholders OK sale.</title>
<headline>First Colony says shareholders OK sale.</headline>
<dateline>LYNCHBURG, Va. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Colony Corp said on Monday that shareholders have approved its sales to General Electric Capital Corp.</p>
<p>The sale, which was announced in August, is expected to become effective December 1.</p>
<p>Under the deal, General Electric Capital is to acquire First Colony for $1.8 billion.</p>
